<!-- ===================== INTRODUCTION PANEL ===================== -->
<section class="tab-panel active" id="tab-intro">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="content-flex">
            <div class="content-text">
                <h3>Hydrogel Film — Full-Wrap Protection That Feels Invisible</h3>
                <p>
                    Rigid tempered glass can't always follow the curve of today's edge displays.
                    SRV India Hydrogel Film is built from a flexible, self-healing polymer that
                    conforms fully to curved and flat screens alike — sealing the entire surface
                    edge-to-edge without a visible border or lifted corner.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Choose HD Clear for maximum visual clarity, or Matte for a soft, fingerprint-
                    resistant texture with reduced glare — both share the same self-healing
                    surface that quietly repairs light scratches and swirl marks within 24 hours.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Finished with a smooth, scratch-proof coating and cut to a universal
                    120 x 195mm sheet for on-site trimming, Hydrogel Film installs easily at home
                    or in-store. Imported premium material, inner pack of 5 PCS — ideal for
                    retailers and dealers.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="content-image" aria-label="Product detail image">
                <img src="~/images/Products/HYDORGEL FILM SRV.png" alt="SRV India Ultra Guard ESD Screen Protector Detail" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

